.. _community_brainsets:

Community brainsets
===================

Community brainsets come from :ref:`brainsets plugins <brainsets_plugins>`: packages
that add brainsets to the ``brainsets`` CLI and are maintained by their authors, not by
torch_brain. Listing a plugin here is a metadata review (licence, public data, cited
sources), not an endorsement of its code.

Install a plugin, then prepare its brainsets with their namespace:

.. code-block:: console

    $ uv add "<install spec below>"
    $ brainsets prepare <namespace>:<brainset_id>

``brainsets list --all`` and ``brainsets info <namespace>`` show the same information
from the command line. To add your plugin, see :ref:`brainsets_plugins_listing`.

